{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279370/extras/notainingbanner.png?t=1743212745\" /><br><br>Plunder Islands is a fast paced arcade style game. You play Pirate Pete, who has to run, jump, and climb to beat each island. Your goal is to collect all the coins from each island then plunder the treasure chests.  No training mode needed.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279370/extras/screen2.png?t=1743212745\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279370/extras/goodbanner.png?t=1743212745\" /><br>Each island has its own unique challenges with no continues!  There are 20 islands plus bonus levels for extra lives.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279370/extras/Screenshot_20230201_100803.png?t=1743212745\" /><br><br>Play on keyboard or controller. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279370/extras/pixelsbanner.png?t=1743212745\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279370/extras/bigpete.png?t=1743212745\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279370/extras/bignavy.png?t=1743212745\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279370/extras/bigparrot.png?t=1743212745\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2279370?t=1743212745","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2279370?t=1743212745","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279370/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743212745","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai